SUMMARY:High School Youth Pilgrimage Presentation (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:Please join us as the youth and leaders share about their summer pilgrimage to Washington DC and Richmond\, VA where we met with legislators on Capitol Hill\, learned about the history of enslavement in our country\, volunteered with organizations seeking to repair the generational wounds of racism\, and lived and prayed with the community at an Urban Monastery. You will be inspired!
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/high-school-youth-pilgrimage-presentation-guild-room/
LOCATION:Guild Room
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Children/Youth,Featured Events
END:VEVENT
