SUMMARY:Let's Watch: ZOOTOPIA 2 (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:“Let’s Watch” hosts the family-friendly “Zootopia 2” in the Guild Room. \nWe kick off the year with the kids-friendly movie: Zootopia 2 (2025\, 1h48).  Zootopia 2 focuses on the themes of the power of unity and acceptance of marginalized communities. \nJust like last year\, we will provide pizza and ice pops\, and the event will be coupled with a “small bites and drinks” get together for parents and other adults on the side in the Assembly Room. \nClick HERE to RSVP for the movie\, so we know how much pizza to order.
